{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KtuiUVNNMHPKNssgRXtHCS","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have a comprehensive understanding. Let me create a detailed summary report:\n\n## Comprehensive Codebase Exploration Report\n\n### 1. PROJECT STRUCTURE\n\n**Framework & Stack:**\n- **Framework**: Next.js 16.1.6 (App Router)\n- **Frontend**: React 19.2.3 with TypeScript\n- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS 4\n- **UI Components**: Radix UI + custom shadcn/ui components\n- **Backend**: Supabase (PostgreSQL)\n- **Forms**: React Hook Form + Zod validation\n- **Internationalization**: next-intl (Spanish & English)\n\n**Directory Structure:**\n```\n/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/\n├── src/\n│   ├── app/[locale]/          # App Router pages\n│   │   ├── page.tsx            # Home page\n│   │   ├── layout.tsx          # Root layout with i18n\n│   │   ├── profile/            # User profile pages\n│   │   ├── login/              # Login page\n│   │   ├── register/           # Registration page\n│   │   ├── complete-profile/   # Profile completion after signup\n│   │   ├── educational/        # Educational content public page\n│   │   └── [locale]/           # Locale wrapper\n│   ├── app/api/                # API routes\n│   │   ├── auth/check-username/ # Username availability check\n│   │   └── health/             # Health check endpoint\n│   ├── app/auth/callback/      # OAuth callback handler\n│   ├── components/\n│   │   ├── ui/                 # Shadcn UI components (button, input, form, etc.)\n│   │   ├── header.tsx          # Navigation header with auth status\n│   │   ├── footer.tsx\n│   │   ├── login-form.tsx      # Login form component\n│   │   ├── registration-form.tsx # Registration form component\n│   │   └── language-switcher.tsx\n│   ├── lib/\n│   │   ├── supabase.ts         # Supabase client initialization\n│   │   └── utils.ts            # Utility functions\n│   ├── i18n/\n│   │   ├── routing.ts\n│   │   ├── request.ts\n│   │   └── config.ts\n│   └── middleware.ts           # Next-intl middleware\n├── messages/\n│   ├── es.json                # Spanish translations\n│   └── en.json                # English translations\n├── supabase/migrations/       # Database schema migrations\n└── public/                    # Static assets\n```\n\n---\n\n### 2. DATABASE SCHEMA (Supabase PostgreSQL)\n\n#### **Profiles Table** (Base user data)\n```sql\nFile: 20260202000000_create_profiles_table.sql\n- id: uuid (PK) - references auth.users\n- full_name: text (unique) - username\n- email: text\n- created_at: timestamptz\n- updated_at: timestamptz\n- Indexes: lower(full_name) for case-insensitive lookups\n- RLS: Users can view/update own profile, public read for username checks\n- Trigger: Auto-creates profile on user signup via handle_new_user()\n```\n\n#### **Memberships Table** (Main feature - membership subscriptions)\n```sql\nFile: 20260202300000_create_memberships_table.sql\n- id: uuid (PK)\n- user_id: uuid (FK to profiles.id, cascading delete)\n- status: enum ('pending', 'active', 'expired')\n- applied_at: timestamptz (when user applied)\n- approved_at: timestamptz (when approved)\n- expires_at: timestamptz (expiration date)\n- payment_reference: text (reference to payment)\n- Indexes: user_id, status\n- RLS: Users can read own memberships, users can apply for membership\n```\n\n#### **Membership Payments Table** (Payment tracking)\n```sql\nFile: 20260202310000_create_membership_payments_table.sql\n- id: uuid (PK)\n- membership_id: uuid (FK to memberships, cascading delete)\n- amount: numeric(10,2)\n- payment_method: enum ('bizum', 'transfer')\n- status: enum ('pending', 'verified')\n- verified_at: timestamptz\n- verified_by: uuid (FK to profiles.id, set null on delete)\n- Indexes: membership_id, status\n- RLS: Users can view/create payments for own memberships\n```\n\n#### **Educational Content Table** (Dynamic content management)\n```sql\nFile: 20260202200000_create_educational_content_table.sql\n- id: uuid (PK)\n- title_es, title_en, content_es, content_en: text\n- category: enum ('rules', 'formats', 'general_info', 'videos')\n- video_url: text (optional)\n- sort_order: integer\n- created_at: timestamptz\n- Indexes: category, sort_order\n- RLS: Public read access\n```\n\n#### **Shadow Players Table** (Non-registered players)\n```sql\nFile: 20260202100000_create_shadow_players_table.sql\n- id: uuid (PK)\n- name: text (unique, case-insensitive)\n- created_at: timestamptz\n- linked_user_id: uuid (FK to profiles, set null on delete)\n- RLS: Public read, admin-only write\n```\n\n---\n\n### 3. AUTHENTICATION SYSTEM\n\n**Auth Provider**: Supabase Auth (PostgreSQL backend)\n\n**Endpoints & Components:**\n- `/app/auth/callback/route.ts` - OAuth callback handler\n  - Exchanges authorization code for session\n  - Checks if user has completed profile\n  - Redirects to `/complete-profile` if username not set\n  \n- `components/login-form.tsx` - Login form\n  - Supports username OR email login\n  - Validates credentials\n  - Handles Google OAuth\n  - Lookup: username → converted to placeholder email format: `username@placeholder.local`\n  \n- `components/registration-form.tsx` - Registration form\n  - Username availability check (debounced)\n  - Optional email\n  - Password validation (min 8 chars)\n  - Creates placeholder email if no email provided\n\n**Auth Flow:**\n1. User registers → Profile created automatically via trigger\n2. If email provided → Verification email sent\n3. User completes profile → Sets username\n4. User logs in with username/email + password\n5. Redirect to profile on authenticated pages\n\n---\n\n### 4. USER PROFILE SYSTEM\n\n**Profile Pages:**\n- `src/app/[locale]/profile/page.tsx` - Main profile page\n- `src/app/[locale]/complete-profile/page.tsx` - Post-signup username completion\n\n**Profile Features** (ProfileContent component):\n- View username (non-editable)\n- View email from auth + profile table\n- View membership status (placeholder - shows \"Active\")\n- View registration date (formatted by locale)\n- Update email functionality\n- Change password functionality (with current password verification)\n- Error/success notifications\n\n**User Data Structure:**\n```typescript\ntype UserProfile = {\n  id: string;                 // From auth.users\n  full_name: string;          // Username (from profiles)\n  email: string | null;       // From profiles + auth.users\n  created_at: string;         // Account creation timestamp\n};\n```\n\n---\n\n### 5. EMAIL NOTIFICATION SYSTEM\n\n**Status**: MINIMAL/NOT IMPLEMENTED\n\n**Current Email Handling:**\n- Registration email verification (optional)\n  - Only sent if user provides email during signup\n  - Handled by Supabase Auth built-in\n  - Redirects to `/auth/callback` on verification\n  \n- Email update verification\n  - When user updates email in profile\n  - Supabase Auth sends verification\n  - User must verify new email\n\n**No Custom Email Service Found:**\n- No SendGrid, Mailgun, or custom email service\n- No email templates in codebase\n- No notification queue system\n- No email notification triggers for:\n  - Membership application\n  - Membership approval/rejection\n  - Payment verification\n  - Password changes\n\n---\n\n### 6. EXISTING ROUTES & PAGES\n\n**Public Routes:**\n- `GET /{locale}/` - Home page\n- `GET /{locale}/educational` - Educational content page (rules, formats, videos)\n- `GET /{locale}/login` - Login page\n- `GET /{locale}/register` - Registration page\n- `GET /api/auth/check-username` - Username availability API\n- `GET /api/health` - Health check endpoint\n\n**Protected Routes** (require authentication):\n- `GET /{locale}/profile` - User profile page\n- `GET /{locale}/complete-profile` - Complete profile after signup\n\n**Planned but Not Implemented:**\n- `/{locale}/tournaments` - Tournaments section\n- `/{locale}/training` - Training/League section\n- `/{locale}/rankings` - Rankings section\n- `/{locale}/bulk-orders` - Bulk orders section\n- `/socios` or `/memberships` - No membership pages found yet\n\n---\n\n### 7. NAVIGATION & HEADER\n\n**Header Navigation Items:**\n```javascript\n[\n  { key: \"educational\", href: \"/educational\" },\n  { key: \"tournaments\", href: \"/tournaments\" },\n  { key: \"training\", href: \"/training\" },\n  { key: \"rankings\", href: \"/rankings\" },\n  { key: \"bulkOrders\", href: \"/bulk-orders\" },\n]\n```\n\n**Authentication Status Display:**\n- Desktop & Mobile menus show different states:\n  - NOT authenticated: \"Login\" + \"Register\" buttons\n  - Authenticated: \"Profile\" link + \"Logout\" button\n- Real-time auth state tracking via `supabase.auth.onAuthStateChange()`\n\n---\n\n### 8. INTERNATIONALIZATION (i18n)\n\n**Supported Languages**: Spanish (es) and English (en)\n\n**Translation Keys Structure** (messages/es.json):\n```json\n{\n  \"common\": {},\n  \"nav\": { \"educational\", \"tournaments\", \"training\", \"rankings\", \"bulkOrders\" },\n  \"auth\": { \"login\", \"logout\", \"profile\", \"register\" },\n  \"login\": { validation errors, submit labels },\n  \"registration\": { validation errors, submit labels },\n  \"completeProfile\": { validation errors },\n  \"profile\": { \"profileInfo\", \"membershipStatus\", \"updateEmail\", \"changePassword\" },\n  \"footer\": {},\n  \"metadata\": { \"title\", \"description\" }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 9. MEMBERSHIP & PAYMENT SYSTEM\n\n**Status**: DATABASE SCHEMA CREATED, NO UI COMPONENTS YET\n\n**Membership Schema:**\n- States: `pending` (applied) → `active` (approved) → `expired`\n- Stores: Application date, approval date, expiration date, payment reference\n- No UI to apply for membership yet\n\n**Payment Schema:**\n- Methods: Bizum (Spanish instant payment) or Bank Transfer\n- Status: `pending` (unverified) → `verified` (admin confirmed)\n- Tracks: Amount, verification date, admin who verified\n\n**Missing Implementation:**\n- No membership application form\n- No payment submission interface\n- No admin dashboard for approving memberships/payments\n- No admin role system (noted in RLS policies as TODO)\n- No payment verification workflow\n\n---\n\n### 10. SECURITY & ROW LEVEL SECURITY (RLS)\n\n**Authentication Requirements:**\n- Profiles: `auth.uid() = id` for own data\n- Memberships: Users can view/insert own only\n- Payments: Nested RLS - can access only if membership owner\n- Educational content: Public read\n- Shadow players: Public read\n\n**Admin Policies**:\n- Currently disabled (`using (false)`)\n- Placeholders for future admin role system\n- Service role (server-side) bypasses RLS entirely\n\n**Middleware:**\n- `next-intl/middleware` for locale routing\n- Excludes: `/api`, `/auth`, `/_next`, `/_vercel`\n\n---\n\n### 11. KEY FILES & ABSOLUTE PATHS\n\n**Database Migrations:**\n- `/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/supabase/migrations/20260202000000_create_profiles_table.sql`\n- `/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/supabase/migrations/20260202100000_create_shadow_players_table.sql`\n- `/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/supabase/migrations/20260202200000_create_educational_content_table.sql`\n- `/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/supabase/migrations/20260202300000_create_memberships_table.sql`\n- `/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/supabase/migrations/20260202310000_create_membership_payments_table.sql`\n\n**Core Pages:**\n- `/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/src/app/[locale]/profile/profile-content.tsx`\n- `/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/src/app/[locale]/complete-profile/complete-profile-content.tsx`\n- `/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/src/app/[locale]/login/login-form.tsx`\n- `/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/src/app/[locale]/register/register-content.tsx`\n- `/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/src/app/[locale]/educational/educational-content.tsx`\n\n**API Routes:**\n- `/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/src/app/api/auth/check-username/route.ts`\n- `/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/src/app/auth/callback/route.ts`\n\n**Components:**\n- `/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/src/components/header.tsx`\n- `/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/src/components/login-form.tsx`\n- `/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/src/components/registration-form.tsx`\n\n**Configuration:**\n- `/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/src/lib/supabase.ts` - Supabase client\n- `/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/src/middleware.ts` - Next-intl middleware\n- `/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/messages/es.json` - Spanish translations\n- `/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/messages/en.json` - English translations\n\n---\n\n### 12. NOTABLE PATTERNS & ARCHITECTURE DECISIONS\n\n**Form Handling:**\n- React Hook Form + Zod for validation\n- Schema created with i18n translation function\n- Debounced async validation (username availability)\n\n**State Management:**\n- Component-level useState\n- Supabase client-side queries for data\n- Real-time auth status tracking\n\n**Type Safety:**\n- Full TypeScript with strict mode\n- Zod schemas for runtime validation\n- Type inference from schemas\n\n**API Design:**\n- Minimal server-side endpoints\n- Most logic in client components\n- RLS provides data security\n\n**Styling:**\n- Tailwind CSS with custom configuration\n- Dark mode support (dark: prefix)\n- Radix UI for accessible components\n\n---\n\n### SUMMARY\n\nThe **Roundnet Spain** application is a Next.js-based platform for managing roundnet community activities. Currently implemented:\n- User authentication (Supabase)\n- User profiles with email/password management\n- Educational content management system\n- Database schema for memberships and payments\n\nStill needed:\n- Membership application pages\n- Payment processing interface\n- Admin dashboard\n- Email notification system\n- Remaining feature pages (tournaments, rankings, etc.)\n- Membership types/configurations"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: af02d02 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"dd558466-2